menu "Box"

config BOX_HOSTNAME
    string "Hostname (the box answers at <hostname>.local)"
    default "box"

config BOX_HTTP_PORT
    int "HTTP API port"
    range 1 65535
    default 80

config BOX_TOKEN
    string "Bearer token required on writes (empty: no auth)"
    default ""
    help
        Set it in firmware/sdkconfig.local.defaults (gitignored), then rebuild
        from clean: an existing build keeps the value it was configured with.

config BOX_PANEL_SIZE
    int "Panel width and height, in LED dots"
    range 8 160
    default 96
    help
        Each dot is 480 / size screen pixels; pick a divisor of 480 (96 gives
        5 px dots) so the grid fills the screen. More dots fit more text.

config BOX_FPS
    int "Frames per second"
    range 1 60
    default 25
    help
        The render loop's rate. It runs on FreeRTOS ticks, so pick a rate
        whose period is a whole number of ticks (25 fps is 4 at 100 Hz).

endmenu
